    <dd>Your 5-star reviews are critical to helping me continue to grow and improve Sticky Buy Button.<br />If you're finding Sticky Buy Button helpful, please consider <a href="https://apps.shopify.com/sticky-buy-now-button?reveal_new_review=true" target="_new">leaving me a 5-star review</a>. It only takes a minute and really makes a difference.</dd>
